      "text": "\nYou’ll ring in the New Year in Quito. A guided walk introduces you to local traditions, and in the evening the hotel hosts a festive dinner with music and dancing. From the capital, the route crosses the Andes to the coast before continuing to the Galápagos Islands.\n\n## Price per person\n\n| Occupancy | Price, USD |\n|---|---:|\n| Triple, TPL | 4,250 |\n| Double, DBL | 4,325 |\n| Single, SGL | 4,970 |\n\nThe itinerary covers mainland Ecuador and the Galápagos Islands. Rates before booking and the itinerary are subject to change without prior notice.\n\n",
      "provenance": {
